CONTRIBUTORS

Contributors retain copyright in their own work and grant this license on
submission. Each entry names its contributor and institution; attribute to
the contributor, not to the project.

Where a contributor could not grant this license — because their institution
owns the assessment, for example — the entry describes the design in the
project's own words and is marked accordingly.

EXCEPTIONS

Rubrics, briefs and handouts under assets/ are distributed as supplied by the
contributor and may carry their institution's own terms. Check the entry
before redistributing those files.

Nothing in this license applies to student work. No student work is published
in this library.
